[2m│[0m [1m[38;5;231mWhich tooling should I set up from the start? Cheapest before any code exists, and it lands in the spec so later work
[0;2m│[0m [1m[38;5;231minherits it.[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Unit tests (Recommended)
  [38;5;246mNode's built-in test runner against validate() and the validators. No dependencies; the whole reason to extract a pure
[39m  [38;5;246mcore.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [ ] Lint + format
  [38;5;246mESLint + Prettier with a standard config. Adds a node_modules and a config file to a repo that currently has neither.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [ ] End-to-end tests
  [38;5;246mPlaywright driving a real browser against the login form. Catches binder/DOM bugs unit tests can't, but heavy for a [39m
  [38;5;246mpage this size.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] None for now
  [38;5;246mShip the module with no test or lint infrastructure; verify by hand in the browser.[39m
